From 2f0e0f3ff5eebc45e38188c1c49a900c26e64167 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gus bourg <gus@bourg.net>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:15:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 03/17] media: amlogic: add the video decoder core and MPEG-1/2
 support

Add the V4L2 mem2mem decoder core, elementary stream parser, canvas
management and MPEG-1/2 decoding for the GX and G12 decoder blocks.

Serialize hardware ownership through teardown, retain the microcode
DMA buffer for the device lifetime, and repoint canvases when capture
buffers change memory. Bound parser padding by the input allocation
and preserve firmware-derived MPEG capture geometry. Capture storage
uses 32-row alignment.

